            "ingredient_type": "plant",
            "title": "Organic Blackberry",
            "description": "<p>Our Canadian-grown organic GMO-free blackberry contains high amounts of ellagic acid, a phytochemical known to be a powerful anti-cancer fighter that also reduces oxidative stress. Rated the 2nd highest antioxidant concentration for all US foods, based on “common serving sizes”. Blackberry's high tannin content tightens tissues, has antiseptic and anti-bacterial properties, and helps relieve intestinal inflammation and diarrhea.</p>",
            "tag_1": "Organic",
