          "type": "ingredient",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/gempages_485391223989732606-a730a9aa-8f99-4bfd-8506-c5499c5a4762.webp",
            "ingredient_type": "plant",
            "title": "Organic Mango",
            "description": "<p>Our organic GMO-free mangoes grown on certified organic farms in Mexico, are a delicious, low-acid fruit known to reduce the risk of cancer. They also contain a high amount of dietary fiber, improving the digestive health of your dog and also reduce the risk of gastrointestinal disorders known to occur in dogs with a low fiber diet. These dietary fibers also increase the rate of absorption of vitamins and minerals in a dogs' intestines. Mangoes' unique dietary fiber benefits are not shared with the dietary fibers of grains.</p>",
            "tag_1": "Organic",
            "tag_1_bg": "#d6249f",
            "tag_1_text": "#ffffff",
