          "type": "ingredient",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/gempages_485391223989732606-f18b55f0-6194-490d-8823-350cc3028bf0.webp",
            "ingredient_type": "plant",
            "title": "Organic Parsley",
            "description": "<p>Smack Pet Food uses organic GMO-free curly parsley grown in Canada. Parsley is a known chemoprotective food. What this means is that it has shown, in animal studies to inhibit tumor formation and even neutralize carcinogens! Furthermore, parsley has shown to increase antioxidant capacity of the blood! Parsley also contains a high amount of Vitamin C, which fights against free-radicals in all water-soluble areas of the body further reducing the development and progression of a wide variety of diseases.</p>",
            "tag_1": "Organic",
