          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/gempages_485391223989732606-0f3b1582-7438-4740-ab98-e2b560767043.webp",
            "ingredient_type": "plant",
            "title": "Organic Cranberry",
            "description": "<p>Our Canadian-grown GMO-free cranberry helps prevent urinary tract infections by inhibiting microorganisms from adhering to the bladder and urinary tract. Cranberry contains high amounts of ellagic acid, a phytochemical known to be a powerful anti-cancer fighter! The tannins found in cranberries help reduce tooth decay and inhibit bad stomach bacteria from adhering to the stomach.</p>",
