            "ingredient_type": "plant",
            "title": "Organic Strawberry",
            "description": "<p>Our organic GMO-free strawberries come from certified organic farms in Canada. In terms of common serving size, strawberries are ranked as the second-most antioxidant containing fruit, just behind blackberry. Strawberry polyphenols help regulate blood sugar levels and even reduce blood sugar spikes. Regular intake of strawberries has also shown to reduce inflammation, the root of nearly all disease!</p>",
