          "type": "ingredient",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/gempages_485391223989732606-241ee66a-aa74-43b4-906a-58aca282d49a.webp",
            "ingredient_type": "plant",
            "title": "Organic Thyme",
            "description": "<p>Rich in an oil called thymol, our organic GMO-free thyme (grown in Egypt) has been proven in studies to protect and significantly increase the percentage of healthy fats found in the cell membranes of the brain, kidney and heart. Thyme also has powerful antimicrobial activity against bacteria such as E. coli, meaning that thyme can actually decontaminate contaminated food!</p>",
