          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/gempages_485391223989732606-9b30bc85-42a9-4d57-9034-12ab3ea9bbcb.webp",
            "ingredient_type": "plant",
            "title": "Organic Peppermint",
            "description": "<p>Smack Pet Food uses organic GMO-free peppermint grown in Egypt. Peppermint is a popular as a remedy to ease indigestion by calming the muscles of the stomach. Peppermint's soothing effects on the smooth muscles of the intestines also make it a great cure for IBS - relieving issues such as gas, diarrhea, and pain due to spasms.</p>",
