          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/gempages_485391223989732606-7ebb903f-088d-49d5-abb5-37ed5403e7f7.webp",
            "ingredient_type": "plant",
            "title": "Organic Kelp",
            "description": "<p>Kelp is a nutrient-packed superfood, providing vitamins like A, B, D, E, and K with plenty of essential minerals, amino acids, and fibre. It's an excellent source of iodine, which is essential for thyroid function, helping maintain your pet's metabolic health. Kelp also helps the body maintain blood sugar levels and provides plenty of cancer-fighting antioxidants. It fosters healthy gut bacteria, immune function, and dental health, for truly far-reaching benefits.</p>",
