          "type": "ingredient",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/gempages_485391223989732606-bb8c0737-039b-4b59-ae87-ffdcb4f09596.webp",
            "ingredient_type": "plant",
            "title": "Dried Yeast",
            "description": "<p>Dried yeast is a true superfood. Because it contains all essential amino acids, it is considered a complete protein, helping boost your pet's energy. It contains beta-glucans, highly beneficial fibers that stimulate white blood cells and support healthy immune function. It's a flavourful, whole-food source of vitamins and minerals that support metabolic health, digestion, coat and skin health, cognitive function, muscle development, bone formation, reproductive health, and more.</p>",
