          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/gempages_485391223989732606-900ea1dc-4a22-43fa-a4ab-788ec0b29485.webp",
            "ingredient_type": "plant",
            "title": "Organic Sprouted Quinoa",
            "description": "<p>Sprouted quinoa provides essential vitamins and minerals linked to improved metabolism and energy, cancer prevention, blood cell and nerve formation, skin and coat health, nervous system and brain function, and immunity. Sprouted quinoa contains fewer lectins and more anti-inflammatory compounds than un-sprouted quinoa, making it much easier on your pet's digestive system.</p>",
