          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/gempages_485391223989732606-98d2c7dd-dca8-495f-85c7-c6a1667c41ea.webp",
            "ingredient_type": "plant",
            "title": "Sea Salt",
            "description": "<p>Salt is an essential mineral for life that helps maintain a proper electrolyte balance, enabling key processes like nerve activation and muscle contraction. It's also a healthy, tasty source of magnesium, which helps regulate blood pressure and fight adrenal fatigue. Smack uses premium salt with lower sodium than other sea salt and more natural mineral electrolytes. It's pure, delicious, and sustainably sourced.</p>",
