            "ingredient_type": "plant",
            "title": "Marine Microalgae Oil",
            "description": "<p>Marine microalgae oil is very high in essential omega-3 fatty acids that contribute to a shinier coat and healthier skin while also supporting heart and joint health. Studies have shown that omega-3s may inhibit compounds that trigger inflammation, helping alleviate joint pain and arthritis.</p>",
